{"overview":"کلمبو یک کارآگاه پلیس گرم و صمیمی، پرحرف و ظاهر ژولیده است که مظنونانش همواره او را دست کم می‌گیرند. علیرغم ظاهر نامطلوب و حواس‌پرتی واضح، او با زیرکی تمام پرونده‌های خود را حل می‌کند و تمام مدارک مورد نیاز برای کیفرخواست را به دست می‌آورد. نگاه گیرای او به جزئیات و رویکرد دقیق و متعهدانه او اغلب تنها در اواخر خط داستان برای قاتل آشکار می‌شود.","tagline":"اوه، فقط یه چیز دیگه...","overview_en":"Columbo is a friendly, verbose, disheveled-looking police detective who is consistently underestimated by his suspects. Despite his unprepossessing appearance and apparent absentmindedness, he shrewdly solves all of his cases and secures all evidence needed for indictment. His formidable eye for detail and meticulously dedicated approach often become clear to the killer only late in the storyline.","tagline_en":"Oh, just one more thing...","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":2,"y":1968,"poster":"/7rp2d6lsKdfS8AdIyV37p1qwRJ1.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":7,"y":1971,"poster":"/9O7rjHpYgcoat3h4fBnoW1XRAAR.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":1972,"poster":"/hPQgn3TEQVmaVat0E0jao2ASv0b.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":8,"y":1973,"poster":"/bYVHfswHtzsHlDpaNz04koH8ZQn.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":6,"y":1974,"poster":"/tftn7xEBZaHx6prDyN8jzNucwv.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":6,"y":1975,"poster":"/oHVFsCdXJrfwNKtWjz6tYWGmMMC.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":3,"y":1976,"poster":"/b90H9ih79II60qfMu9F7kHRN6dY.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":5,"y":1977,"poster":"/pBQofkbUfPpcvMhrbZ2NRTBUnhP.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":4,"y":1989,"poster":"/wY8SKSf3cDtMEmPsaSHh8c08W9B.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":6,"y":1989,"poster":"/bfqROgt6p8g91wrMoEXuMFkNsnJ.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":14,"y":1990,"poster":"/7uCtGcJBns5MaRnG0Ik1JFiu8Mn.jpg"}],"episodes":67,"crew":["William Link","Richard Levinson"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Peter Falk","role":"Lt. Columbo","photo":"/e59x8ITouNlyz8Qa2abb5lxiQvI.jpg"}],